                <pb facs="0215" n="113" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg113"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/426.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador White to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-11-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 30,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>French Government have no objection to the substitution of the date of February 1
                    to January 1 for the meeting of the opium commission at Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
